1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:05,000
Salom! Bu admin panel bo'yicha qisqa qo'llanma.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,600
Avval kirish: botga slesh admin va parolni yozib, tugmani bosing.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:16,600
Yoki admin ilovaga parolni kiriting. Parolni faqat adminlarga bering.

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:19,500
Yangi buyurtmalar shu yerda.

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:23,800
Ism, manzil, mahsulotlar va jami summa ko'rinadi.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,800
Telefon tugmasi — qo'ng'iroq.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,100
Yetkazib bergach, Bajarildi tugmasini bosing.

8
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:33,400
Filtr bilan holat bo'yicha ajrating.

9
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,300
Endi, Mahsulot bo'limi.

10
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:43,700
Narxni va ombordagi sonini yozing, so'ng Saqlash tugmasini bosing. Ombor har buyurtmada o'zi kamayadi.

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:01:06,500
Yangi mahsulot qo'shish uchun, plyus tugmasini bosing. Rasm yuklang, nomini, narxini va sonini yozing, so'ng Saqlashni bosing. Mahsulot do'konda darrov paydo bo'ladi.

12
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,900
Aksiya bo'limi: skidka va promokod.

13
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:18,700
Skidka uchun nom va foizni yozib, saqlang. Narxlar o'zi arzonlashadi.

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:25,600
Promokod uchun kod va foizni yozing. Mijoz savatda shu kodni kiritsa, chegirma oladi.

15
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:32,500
Haftalik hisobot har yakshanba kechqurun, soat sakkizda, o'zi keladi. Hozir ham yuborish mumkin.

16
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Tayyor! Admin panel shunchalik oson. Omad!

